Say on the About page (brave://settings/help) that this is an unofficial build.

It is compiled from source by a Gentoo overlay, not distributed by Brave
Software; the notice goes below the Brave and Chromium versions.

diff --git a/brave/browser/resources/settings/br/about_page.ts b/brave/browser/resources/settings/br/about_page.ts
index 40a800a..b1f9999 100644
